Third-party software
--------------------

scenelift does not bundle any model weights or model code. The optional model
backends (MapAnything, SAM 3, SAM 3D Objects) are separate projects, installed
by the user from their own repositories under their own licences. See
docs/BACKENDS.md.

The compiled front end in scenelift/studio/static contains the following
open-source libraries and the packages they depend on. The exact versions are
recorded in frontend/package-lock.json.

  React and React DOM       MIT licence
  three.js                  MIT licence
  @react-three/fiber        MIT licence
  @react-three/drei         MIT licence
  zustand                   MIT licence
  Lucide (lucide-react)     ISC licence

The Python dependencies listed in requirements.txt are installed by the user
and are not redistributed with this repository.
